# UML dojo, use case diagram 09 "A special use case" (model answer of the learning platform). Reporting a grid
# failure is a special case of reporting a failure.
diagram usecase "Serviceportal" subtitle="Generalisierung von Anwendungsfällen" locale=de
actor kunde "Kunde"
subject portal "Serviceportal"
usecase melden "Störung melden" in portal
usecase netz "Netzstörung melden" in portal
rel kunde -- melden
rel netz -|> melden
